-- Pakistan deep-dive content (English). Pakistan's story is a genuine
-- real-time API clearance model -- like Indonesia's Coretax, FBR
-- validation is now a legal precondition for a valid invoice -- but
-- layered on top of a much messier real-world compliance picture than
-- most countries in this tracker: the formal 31 December 2025 deadline
-- was met on paper, but live adoption has genuinely lagged behind it,
-- confirmed directly by FBR's own officials well into mid-2026.
-- Live-researched against FBR's own SRO PDFs (fbr.gov.pk /
-- download1.fbr.gov.pk), EY/KPMG/PwC/Crowe tax alerts, and Pakistani
-- business press. mandate_summary and timeline_intro deliberately kept
-- short (per the lesson of migration 355, which had to trim six
-- countries whose these fields crept to 150-190 words).









